# 🔴 Local object storage. Uploaded invoices, rendered PDFs and raw webhook
# bodies land here under the `local` storage backend — real customer documents
# with real GSTINs and real amounts. R11 forbids production PII in the repo,
# and an uploaded invoice is exactly that.
var/

# Data — 🔴 R11: no production PII in the repo, ever. Not "just for a test".
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.dump
*.sql.gz
/data/

